# CLI

`cli/main.py` registers commands. Bodies live in `cli/commands/`. Domain logic stays in `infra/`.

Pick one transport per command:

| Layer | When | Support |
|-------|------|---------|
| Offline | Local `~/.octop` SQLite only | `cli/support/db.py`, `offline_ops.py` |
| Embedded | Needs harness or gateway; boots `OctopServer` | `cli/support/embedded_ops.py` |
| External | OS or daemon, no Octop HTTP | Ollama, QR bind, Feishu bot-creator |

`octop run` (`cli/commands/run.py`) delegates to `launch.run_foreground_blocking`. There is no `octop user login` — the CLI trusts the local `~/.octop` tree. Pin the user with `octop config set-user` or `--user`; pin the agent with `octop agent use` or `--agent`. Config writes apply after restart when `octop run` is already up.

Do not import `api/`.
